9. Functional Requirements
9.1 Label Upload
Users must be able to:
Upload one or multiple label images
Preview uploaded files
Remove or replace uploads before processing

9.2 OCR Text Extraction
The system must:
Detect and extract visible text
Support imperfect images
Handle rotated or angled labels
Process glare and lighting variability where possible

9.3 AI-Assisted Field Detection
The application should identify:
Brand names
Beverage classifications
Alcohol percentages
Proof statements
Net contents
Bottler/importer details
Government warning text

9.4 Compliance Comparison Engine
The system must compare extracted values against application form values and classify results as:
Match
Possible mismatch
Missing information
Formatting issue

9.5 Warning Statement Validation
The application must:
Detect warning presence
Compare wording exactly
Validate capitalization patterns
Flag altered or incomplete text

9.6 Batch Processing
Users must be able to:
Upload multiple labels simultaneously
View processing status
Review results individually
Sort or filter flagged labels

9.7 Human Review Interface
The interface should:
Present side-by-side comparisons
Highlight mismatches visually
Show confidence scores
Allow reviewer overrides

