16. Conclusion
This prototype aims to demonstrate that modern OCR and AI-assisted verification tools can substantially reduce repetitive manual work in alcohol label compliance review workflows.
The application focuses on practical usability, rapid processing, transparent validation, and human-in-the-loop decision support rather than full automation.
If successful, the prototype could help inform future TTB modernization initiatives and procurement decisions regarding AI-assisted compliance review systems.
